console.log(getX()); // 5
setX(6);
console.log(getX()); // 6

```

Closures can close over imported values as well, which are regarded as _live[bindings](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Binding)_, because when the original value changes, the imported one changes accordingly.
