setupHelp();

```

This example uses `const` instead of `var`, so every closure binds the block-scoped variable, meaning that no additional closures are required.
Another alternative could be to use `forEach()` to iterate over the `helpText` array and attach a listener to each [`<input>`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/input), as shown:
