```
function foo() {
  return "bar";
}
console.log(`${foo}`);
// function foo() {
//   return "bar";
// }

```

This source text is _exact_ , including any interspersed comments (which won't be stored by the engine's internal representation otherwise).
jsCopy to Clipboard
```
function foo /* a comment */() {
  return "bar";
}
console.log(foo.toString());
// function foo /* a comment */() {
//   return "bar";
// }

```

