[`WeakMap.prototype.set()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/WeakMap/set)

Sets the `value` for the `key` in the `WeakMap` object. Returns the `WeakMap` object.
