Above, we mentioned **Loops** , a very important concept in programming, which allow you to keep running a piece of code over and over again, until a certain condition is met.
Let's explore a basic example to show you with this means. Go to your [browser developer tools JavaScript console](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Howto/Tools_and_setup/What_are_browser_developer_tools) again, paste the following code into it, and press `Enter`/`Return`:
