This code creates a variable containing a list of all the paragraphs inside `<div class="resultParas">` using the [`querySelectorAll()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/querySelectorAll "querySelectorAll\(\)") method, then it loops through each one, removing the text content of each.
