### [Basic Example](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/AbsoluteOrientationSensor#basic_example)
The following example, which is loosely based on `AbsoluteOrientationSensor` with a frequency of 60 times a second. On each reading it uses [`OrientationSensor.quaternion`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/OrientationSensor/quaternion) to rotate a visual model of a phone.
