  * `format`: The detected barcode format. (For a full list of formats, consult the [supported barcode format](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Barcode_Detection_API#supported_barcode_formats)) list.
  * `rawValue`: A string decoded from the barcode data.


