### [Requesting a background sync](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Background_Synchronization_API#requesting_a_background_sync)
The following asynchronous function registers a background sync from a browsing context:
jsCopy to Clipboard
```
async function syncMessagesLater() {
  const registration = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;
  try {
    await registration.sync.register("sync-messages");
  } catch {
    console.log("Background Sync could not be registered!");
  }
}

```

### [Verifying a background sync by Tag](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Background_Synchronization_API#verifying_a_background_sync_by_tag)
