## [Example](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Battery_Status_API#example)
In this example, we watch for changes both to the charging status (whether or not we're plugged in and charging) and for changes to the battery level and timing. This is done by listening for the [`chargingchange`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/BatteryManager/chargingchange_event "chargingchange"), [`levelchange`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/BatteryManager/levelchange_event "levelchange"), [`chargingtimechange`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/BatteryManager/chargingtimechange_event "chargingtimechange"), [`dischargingtimechange`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/BatteryManager/dischargingtimechange_event "dischargingtimechange") events.
