### [Read font family](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSSFontFeatureValuesRule#read_font_family)
In this example, we declare two [`@font-feature-values`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@font-feature-values) one for the _Font One_ font family, and the other for _Font Two_. We then use the CSSOM to read these font families, displaying them into the log.
